OL,3,GNEWSA'This is the final offer,' says NI
OL,4,Asecretary over #1.5bn Stormont funding
OL,5,Apackage
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I don't want to legislate for a
OL,8,Fbudget. I want to sit down and I'll be
OL,9,Fas cooperative as I possibly can," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
